  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Maize Production and Marketing Value Chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture, Maize and its products i.e., maize for human consumption and animal feeds, other cereals, Beneficiaries: 94 farmers 36 women and 58 men, Description: Project funds will be used to diversify maize production, organize markets to realize better incomes as well as ensuring availability of adequate food for their community. As well as diversify into maize seeds production, maize flour production and animal feed production. Some of the grant will be used as working capital to support the acquisition of inputs and make it accessible to farmer members of Ibumila AMCOS.</narrative>
  </description>
